    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c2_body",
      "x": 81,
      "y": 334,
      "width": 288,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Armed with these recovered boundary\nlines, static and dynamic codebase\nprofiling begins. Extracting abstract\nsyntax trees and mining runtime\ninvariants\u2014such as pointer lifetimes and\nmemory layouts\u2014determines idiomatic\ntarget equivalents and defines the\nglobal migration strategy.",
      "originalText": "Armed with these recovered boundary\nlines, static and dynamic codebase\nprofiling begins. Extracting abstract\nsyntax trees and mining runtime\ninvariants\u2014such as pointer lifetimes and\nmemory layouts\u2014determines idiomatic\ntarget equivalents and defines the\nglobal migration strategy.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10
    },
