    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c3_body",
      "x": 81,
      "y": 484,
      "width": 288,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "These profiles and invariant models form\nthe foundation for structural\ndecomposition. Breaking monolithic files\ninto dependency-ordered syntax fragments\nresolves cyclic imports through reverse-\ntopological scheduling and generates\ncompilable skeleton targets to anchor\ntranslated logic.",
      "originalText": "These profiles and invariant models form\nthe foundation for structural\ndecomposition. Breaking monolithic files\ninto dependency-ordered syntax fragments\nresolves cyclic imports through reverse-\ntopological scheduling and generates\ncompilable skeleton targets to anchor\ntranslated logic.",
