    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c4_body",
      "x": 81,
      "y": 729,
      "width": 281,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "With the skeleton scaffolds in place,\nchunked code translation commences.\nTranslating one scheduled fragment at a\ntime while threading a rolling symbol\ntable and querying active language\nservers produces type-safe target\nimplementations that remain globally\nsynchronized.",
      "originalText": "With the skeleton scaffolds in place,\nchunked code translation commences.\nTranslating one scheduled fragment at a\ntime while threading a rolling symbol\ntable and querying active language\nservers produces type-safe target\nimplementations that remain globally\nsynchronized.",
