    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c7_body",
      "x": 1896,
      "y": 689,
      "width": 288,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "When compiler diagnostics show errors or\nsemantic doubts emerge, an independent\njudge panel convenes. Comparing runtime\nexecution traces and edge-case behavior\nbetween source and target programs\nquantifies behavioral equivalence and\nidentifies semantic discrepancies.",
